  "description": "Straya is an Action based First Person Shooter set in Australia around the late 1960's. With a focus on surviving the many dangerous animals that inhabit the land, air and water, the player can perform jobs, hunt, collect and roam freely in an open world.\n\r\n\n\r\nTravel by foot, horse, chopper and boats.\n\r\nCollect bush tucker to craft elixers.\n\r\nUse the metal detector to find valuables and avoid land mines.\n\r\nPan for gold and fish in the creeks and rivers.\n\r\nGet access to special items by performing jobs and discovering locations.\n\r\nExperience elements based on the Dreamtime stories.",
